OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'World Championships medal was
OL,4,Apinch-me moment'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent para cyclist has described
OL,7,Funexpectedly winning a bronze medal at
OL,8,Fthe World Championships in the
OL,9,FNetherlands as a "pinch-me moment".
OL,11,FJacob Smith, from Tunbridge Wells, had
OL,12,Fto learn to walk again after a ruptured
OL,13,Ftumour on his spinal cord, which left
OL,14,Fhim with impaired function on his left
OL,15,Fside.
OL,17,FThe 26-year-old joined the GB programme
OL,18,Fthree years ago, and his bronze medal
OL,19,Fin October has given him reassurance
OL,20,Fthat his goal to reach the LA
OL,21,FParalympics is achievable.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
